# Extension ZIP packaging

When the user asks to **build the release zip**, **package the extension**, **create extension-unpacked.zip**, or **zip dist** for Chrome load-unpacked / GitHub releases:

1. Follow **[`../skills/build-extension-zip/SKILL.md`](../skills/build-extension-zip/SKILL.md)** — `bun run build` plus PowerShell **`ZipFile::CreateFromDirectory`** on `dist/` so **`manifest.json`** is at the zip root.

For a plain **`bun run build`** with no zip artifact requested, the zip step is optional.
